RedirectMatch 301 ^/day-tours-iceland/reykjavik/?$ https://www.lilja-tours.com/private-day-tours-iceland/
RedirectMatch 301 ^/day-tours-iceland/sightseeing/?$ https://www.lilja-tours.com/private-day-tours-iceland/
